    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1672397610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Y'all ready for a ride like none other? I'm talkin' beer, fine country ladies, and the craziest decked out trucks you ever done seen. I'm talkin' Redneck Party, boy! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/ae515f528d792d5bd78512813c433924.poster.avif?t=1672397610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/ae515f528d792d5bd78512813c433924.webm?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/ae515f528d792d5bd78512813c433924.mp4?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Show off your skills as you fix and upgrade some serious horsepower. Customise your wheels by painting body colors, selecting stickers and much more. All brakes are out. Enjoy the party!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/31a88b4ded787312f55de090c2a2322c.poster.avif?t=1672397610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/31a88b4ded787312f55de090c2a2322c.webm?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/31a88b4ded787312f55de090c2a2322c.mp4?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br>And most important<br>- Drive Monster Trucks <br>- Repair / Fix Monster Trucks <br>- Become the most popular guy at the party<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/7c1a6b60f82496fbb1604ffe648121f9.poster.avif?t=1672397610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/7c1a6b60f82496fbb1604ffe648121f9.webm?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/7c1a6b60f82496fbb1604ffe648121f9.mp4?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It's a Redneck Party Time !!! <br><br>- Pick up girls <br>- Custiomise your machine<br>- Grab a beer and enjoy<br>- Compete with other dudes <br>- Change parts <br>- Manage your budget<br>- Use Cuckie cutter to cut parts <br>- Make sure your's is Bigger <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/ed45856d945b1d92985d22e1e5227b07.poster.avif?t=1672397610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/ed45856d945b1d92985d22e1e5227b07.webm?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1327200/extras/ed45856d945b1d92985d22e1e5227b07.mp4?t=1672397610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Big Wheels, Big Cars, Big Guys <br>Be one of them!",
